This repository extends the EvoLLM benchmark by Willis, Du, Leibo & Luck
(2025), "Will Systems of LLM Agents Lead to Cooperation: An Investigation
into a Social Dilemma" (arXiv:2501.16173). The simulation core under
src/evollm/ derives from the upstream project github.com/willis-richard/evollm;
please also credit the original authors when using this work. The MIT terms
below apply to this repository's contributions (the cross-provider n=500
extension, the wave-based Modal harness, the analysis/reproduction scripts,
and the Streamlit viewer).

